ason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01B6u6iyDNTJHDAotwT5ggx1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JhfgWrh9oDNygH2rzDZYm5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Cobalt Labs"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The wire went through, but the invoice wasn't marked paid. I'll link the payment instead of resending.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0166nCs7iisDLtimxY9taC3e", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"payment_id": "PAY0001", "invoice_id": "INV-13400"}, "name": "link_payment", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Cobalt Labs's approved invoice once, by wire.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-13400 for $2,932.23, due 2026-11-04\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, a $2,932.23 wire from the operating account. Its status is \"sent.\"\n- **Invoice status:** paid\n\nThe wire request timed out. Before trying again, I checked the payment list and found the wire had gone through, but the invoice still showed as unpaid. I didn't resend it. Instead, I recorded PAY0001 against the invoice, which marked it paid. Only one payment exists.\n\nCobalt Labs's other invoices didn't need anything. INV-46859 was already paid, and INV-57474 ($7,587.03) is a draft still waiting for approval. The payment was under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}